  "notes": [
    "**Tomar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **tomado** (regular)",
    "Very versatile verb in Latin America: to take, to drink, to have (food/drinks)",
    "Common usage: *tomar café* (to have coffee), *tomar el bus* (to take the bus), *tomar una foto* (to take a photo)",
    "More common than **beber** for \"to drink\" in Latin America",
    "Expression: *tomar el pelo* (to pull someone's leg), *tomar en cuenta* (to take into account)",
    "Related noun: **la toma** (taking, shot/take in film)"
  ],
